186	
187	To address potential concerns about threshold arbitrariness, \Cref{tab:threshold} reports $K^*$ under four threshold values. $K^*=2$ is perfectly stable in the range $\theta \in [0.60, 0.65]$. At $\theta=0.55$ (near chance), some models shift to $K^*=3$; at $\theta=0.70$ (overly strict), most drop to $K^*=1$. The operating point $\theta=0.60$ balances between these extremes.
